# Vulnerabilities accepted after review. Revisit when upgrading to Spring Framework 7.

# spring-webmvc: RCE via improper path limitation in XsltView.
# Only fixed in Spring 7.0.9 (no Spring 6.x fix). This app does not use XsltView
# (views are JSPs via InternalResourceViewResolver), so the vulnerable code path is unreachable.
# Reviewed: 2026-11-06
